OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warnings issued with
OL,4,Arisk of flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,7,Fwarning for thunderstorms for Kent,
OL,8,FSurrey and West Sussex on Wednesday in
OL,9,Fplace from 03:00 until 22:00 BST.
OL,11,FThe weather service said there may be
OL,12,Fdisruption from thunderstorms and
OL,13,Fsurface water flooding which could
OL,14,Faffect homes, businesses and transport.
OL,16,FA Met Office spokesperson said: "Many
OL,17,Fplaces will miss these, but where they
OL,18,Fdo occur they may be intense leading to
OL,19,Fsome surface water flooding."
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
